{"id":38876388595,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAJDTac8w","head_branch":"fix/speedup-coc-regen_2.43","head_sha":"2849f8fe4693f75cf206010565f7cc52b492d554","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53866,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"backport: perf: Speed up COC regeneration [DHIS2-22203]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":105354835755,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAYh6M3Kw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595","pull_requests":[{"id":4885879261,"number":25765,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25765","head":{"ref":"fix/speedup-coc-regen_2.43","sha":"2849f8fe4693f75cf206010565f7cc52b492d554","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.43","sha":"61613e50835d53654c1f656a7c93cf439830ed7b","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-10-16T08:50:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:03:02Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-16T08:50:36Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/105354835755","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38876388595/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"perf: Speed up COC regeneration [DHIS2-22203] (#25468)\n\n* perf: Make category option combo regeneration linear in the number of combos\n\nRegenerating the option combos of a large category combo (e.g. 5000 x 2 options, 10,000\ncombos) took ~15s, and was slower on master than on 2.41:\n\n- each persisted option combo was matched by scanning all generated option combos\n- each persisted option combo's category options were lazy loaded one query at a time\n- every generated option combo was linked back onto its category options, lazy loading\n  each option's full set of option combos, including for combos that already existed\n- a generated option combo computed its name on every getName() call by scanning each\n  category's option list\n\nGenerated option combos are now indexed by their category options, the persisted option\ncombos are preloaded with their options, only added option combos are linked back to their\noptions, and generated option combos are named once when generated.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* test: Cover category option combo regeneration query count and naming\n\n- regenerating the option combos of a category combo must not lazy load per option combo\n  (15 vs 60 option combos give the same number of per-row loads)\n- regeneration adds the combos of a new option, deletes them when it is removed, and a\n  repeated run changes nothing\n- generated option combos are named exactly as an unnamed option combo computes its name,\n  including an option shared by two categories\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* refactor: Split up category option combo regeneration for Sonar\n\nMoves the generated option combo index into a record and the add-if-missing step into its\nown method, to reduce cognitive complexity and keep the indexing loop separate from the add\nloop. No behaviour change.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* perf: Skip needless session flushes when regenerating category option combos\n\nThe preload queries only read, but each one auto flushed first, dirty\nchecking every entity already in the session: up to 10,000 COCs and\n5,000 category options for a large category combo. The preload queries\nnow use COMMIT flush mode, and the persisted COCs are loaded before\ngeneration, so the one remaining flush (the combo lookup by UID, which\nkeeps its sharing filter) runs before every category option is loaded.\n\n10,000 COCs: regenerate with nothing to add 345 -\u003e 278ms, save the\ncategory combo 603 -\u003e 541ms, regenerate all combos 1175 -\u003e 794ms.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* docs: Note preload skips flush [DHIS2-22203]","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"2849f8fe4693f75cf206010565f7cc52b492d554","tree_id":"1395d15b9c819eea81f57e82f590fc8898242779","timestamp":"2026-10-16T08:50:24Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.c